  "prefLabel": "Env-Or 612.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Or 612.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to establish procedures and criteria for requesting a waiver from one or more requirements established in Env-Or 600.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Or 600) #8812, eff 2-1-07; ss by #10831, eff 6-1-15; ss by #14419, eff 11-4-25, EXPIRES: 11-4-35",
